{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16916","headline":"春分与诸公同宴呈陆三十四郎中 · 武元衡","name":"春分与诸公同宴呈陆三十四郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国宴佳宾，交情老倍亲。\n月慙红烛泪，花笑白头人。\n宝瑟常余怨，琼枝不让春。\n更闻歌子夜，桃李艳妆新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}